---
title: Strawberry Milkshake
servings: 2
time required: 5 minutes
course: Dessert
cuisine: American
image: https://www.lovefromtheoven.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/strawberry-milkshake-24.jpg
---

In a #blender, blend together @vanilla ice cream{2%scoops}(heaping), @milk{1%cup} and @frozen strawberries{1/2%cup} until smooth. Top with @?fresh strawberry{} and @?whip cream{} as desired.